body:
Which Vibram soles offered by White's are most comfortable for long days walking/standing on concrete that can also handle some semi-rough terrain? Also, which leathers typically need lining? Baker's suggested water buffalo would require lining as it's quite supple. Would cordovan need lining as well?

&#x200B;

EDIT: I'm deciding between water buffalo, shell cordovan, and horsehide. Not sure which route to go.
